### Validation in agent-loop.ts

Before calling `tool.execute(call.input)`, validate with TypeBox:
```typescript
import { Value } from '@sinclair/typebox/value';

const valid = Value.Check(tool.schema, call.input);
if (!valid) {
  const errors = [...Value.Errors(tool.schema, call.input)];
  return { content: `Invalid arguments: ${errors.map(e => e.message).join(', ')}`, isError: true };
